ura actually  concentrating mass quantities into one  gigantic attack which if it fails  leaves him in a pretty abysmal position  and no killer isn't quite that bad  because he's much more careful about  maintaining oral reserves which results  in attacks like lightning palm for  example which is a simple palm strike  infused with electricity upon impact and  then swiftly deactivated thus providing  a sharp potent attack at minimal cost  although something like this is  generally not enough to deal with  stronger opponents especially nen users  so kilauea does need to push a little  further in that regard  and that would bring us to thunderbolt  an ability that is fairly  self-explanatory but it sees killer will  leap into the air above an opponent and  call down a powerful bolt of lightning  to strike said opponent this has  problems as well though because whilst  this might seem like quite the deadly  strike it's actually surprisingly weak  and its primary use is for stunning  opponents rather than dealing any damage  to them and to be fair it was quite  successful in stunning yupi a chimera  ant royal guard so we should not dismiss  that ability at all on the other hand it  was also unable to really inflict any  damage on remote  even before he became an end user so the  great advantage of thunderbolt is to  allow an ally of killer to attack the  opponent while stunned which was indeed  very effective as shown with gone  in the remote situation and this  actually brings up something very  important  which is that while this series is  designed to examine the individual's use  of nen  on many occasions that use is going to  be supplementary to someone or something  else  and while it might be quite tempting to  think of kilauea as someone who has  developed abilities to become a core  combatant in reality most of what he  does  is catered towards assisting others  specifically gone but also alako of  course  much of killua's development in nen is  done parallel to gon with killua  studying his friend and carefully  catering his hatsu to augment gonz  and that's one reason why kilauea's  nenus is not at all damage focused  because that's pretty much the only  thing that gonz nen tends to focus on  and in addition to that if kilowatt does  need to cause serious damage or even a  bit of the old death then he tends to  rely on his assassin skills using nen to  stun  confuse disarm trick whatever whilst he  engages in his prior mastery of the art  of killing  now to continue along this path kilowatt  does have at least one way of attaining  more control over his electrical  transmutation which is through the  vessel of delightful yo-yos  delightful yo-yos made from a custom  ally that weigh 50 kilograms each so  that's about 110 pounds per yoyo for all  the pounding people  out there assumedly made four kilowatt  by milliki now this might also be a  simple case of the yoyos taken quite  nicely to transmuted electricity but  here it's also good to note that  kilowatt may be invoking another  nanofinity such as enhancement to imbue  the yoyos with already transmuted aura  or to enhance the yoyos with aura and  then transmute the aura either way  it would work there's no real evidence  to confirm this one way or the other but  during greed island killua did engage in  extensive training in both enhancement  and conjuration which would obviously be  killer's neighboring affinities on the  nenring so he really is far more skilled  than i think even the average fan would  give him credit for although with that  in mind  to be fair all of killer's signature  abilities are attributed as being pure  transmutation  which brings us to the summit of  killer's nenus being the godspeed hatsu  now rather than a more outward use of  electricity that we've examined thus far  this is far more of an internal  application that exhibits itself in two  subforms the first of which being  whirlwind now the general idea is that  in this form killua is programming his  aura to send electrical signals directly  to his muscles  essentially trying and succeeding to  bypass the nervous system when  responding to stimuli and thus  attaining much faster reflex actions and  in the most basic of basic examples  let's say that you touch something hot  at that point the receptors in your hand  need to send signals to the brain which  then needs to send a signal to whatever  part of your body needs to produce a  reflexive response which would usually  be  take your hand off the hot thing you  idiot meanwhile with whirlwind killer  gets to skip this middle step altogether  instead now when his aura encounters the  stimuli the aura itself will immediately  send the right reactionary response  directly to killer's muscles and in  super super basic terms this gives  killua access to speed and agility that  is only surpassed by the truly godlike  figures of the hunt hunter world  however as always there is balance to be  maintained being that whilst using  whirlwind  killer is obviously not in control of  any of his functions it's kind of like  charnock's autopilot where killer just  flicks the switch and hope that  everything  turns out for the best which speaking of  there is a striking similarity between  whirlwind and charnock's autopilot and  it brings up the potential of kilawa  perhaps invoking manipulation  specifically in regards to  pre-programming his aura that is  something that should not theoretically  be available to killer through  transmutation  enhancement or conjuration however  manipulation would of course be killer's  weakest affinity which isn't to say that  he's definitely not using it it would  just make him all the more impressive if  this was indeed the case but for some  more control there is indeed a secondary  application of god speed which is known  as speed of lightning and it more or  less has the same explanation as  whirlwind except that killer maintains  his executive functions and it is not up  t